    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Compact Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: Armored Chassis, TUp (Enhanced) Autopilot Terminal, Bulletproof Glass [x2], Combat Plow, TUp (Self-Driving Vehicle) Communications Center, Heavy Chassis, Reinforced Tires, Sealed Environment, Onboard Rocket Pod. Drives itself at Skill Base 14; no Maneuvers except an Emergency Stop, unless the fare buys more. <strong>Basic</strong> 50eb a district (100eb minimum): avoids nothing. <strong>Super</strong> 100eb a district (500eb minimum): dodges police and traffic when it can, never fights. <strong>Excelsior</strong> 500eb a district (1,000eb minimum): uses every weapon and system it has to protect you, police and corp security included.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 64,500eb<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 8 (Delamain)<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 50<br><strong>SP:</strong> 13<br><strong>Seats:</strong> 4<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 20<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 100 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
